      "role": "user",
      "content": "not bad. i like the part about the bark being scarred. it's a good start.\n\nactually, looking at the engine logs, the quests around this area are coming back with really low depth scores because they're too short. i know i said not to pad it, but if it's under a certain threshold the system just flags it as \"low quality\" and won't even let the player interact. \n\ncan you expand on this a bit? maybe dive deeper into what she actually sees when she looks at the void, or some specific lore about the \"Old Void\" itself. just keep it meaningful and don't do anything weird like repeating yourself, i just need more substance so it passes the check.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
