      "role": "user",
      "content": "thx, erebus is a cool name. that definitely adds some depth. \n\nim looking at the report again though and the depth score is still bottoming out. i think we might need to go even bigger to ensure it clears the threshold for the level design team. i don't want you to just use filler, but can you really flesh this out? \n\nmaybe describe the actual atmosphere of the hollow in more detail, the way the air feels, the sounds, the way the void influences the environment around her. just make it much more substantial and long so we don't have to touch it again. please don't just repeat words or loop, just give me a massive, detailed lore dump of her surroundings and the void's influence.",
      "source": "evaluator"
